    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on the 17/12/2025, the existing use of an events venue and banqueting suite was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove that, on the balance of probability, the existing use of an events venue and banqueting suite at 'Nakshatra Banqueting Hall Snakey Lane Feltham, TW13 7NA' was continuous for an uninterrupted period of at least ten years prior to the date of submission of this application and is therefore deemed lawful. No contradictory evidence has been found to indicate otherwise. \r\n"
